## Summary

Simplifies OpenTelemetry integration by unifying event emission and improving error handling patterns.

## Changes

### 1. `events.rs` - Simplified event emission
```diff
- use tracing::{debug, event, Level};
- use crate::observability::otel_trace::is_otel_enabled;
+ use tracing::info;

  fn emit(&self) {
-     if !is_otel_enabled() {
-         debug!("Sending request to {}", self.url);
-     } else {
-         event!(Level::INFO, url = %self.url, "Sending requests");
-     }
+     info!(url = %self.url, "Sending request");
  }
```

### 2. `otel_trace.rs` - Multiple improvements

| Change | Before | After |
|--------|--------|-------|
| Filter storage | `HashSet<String>` | `OnceLock<[&'static str; 2]>` |
| Filter matching | Exact match | `starts_with()` prefix match |
| Init error handling | `catch_unwind` | Proper `?` propagation |
